WEBVTT

00:02:58.605 --> 00:03:03.670
Humans have an extraordinary capacity
to set goals and strive to achieve them.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:07.027
I've long been inspired
by President John F. Kennedy's

00:03:07.051 --> 00:03:11.476
1961 mission to put a man
on the moon within a decade.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.826
He named it the Moonshot.

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:15.206
It seemed crazy.

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:17.656
We'd only just launched
the first satellite.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:21.413
Putting a man on the moon
that quickly seemed impossible.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:25.086
But this simple challenge
encompassed so much.

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:28.326
He called it a goal
to organize and measure

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:30.593
the best of our energies and skills.